@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Waiting : power on / find LCD,\nsend HELLO
state Waiting : entry / LCD "Step up to scan"
state Holding : entry / LCD "Hold still" + bar
state Scanning : entry / send READY,\nLCD "Scanning face..."
state Result {
  state Granted : entry / "ACCESS GRANTED",\ntwo rising tones
  state Denied : entry / "ACCESS DENIED",\none long low tone
  state Already : entry / "ALREADY INSIDE",\ntwo short beeps
}
state Leaving : entry / LCD "Next student"
state Testing : LCD, buzzer and\ndistance tests
Waiting --> Holding : distance in 25-50 cm
Holding --> Waiting : out of window > 200 ms
Holding --> Scanning : held 1 s / beep
Scanning --> Granted : G
Scanning --> Denied : D
Scanning --> Already : A
Scanning --> Waiting : student left / send AWAY
Scanning --> Waiting : no answer in 6 s /\nLCD "No answer"
Result --> Leaving : after 3 s
Leaving --> Waiting : distance > 65 cm
Waiting --> Testing : T command from PC
Testing --> Waiting : TX or after 120 s
@enduml
